{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04617","headline":"送考功武员外学士使嵩山署舍利塔 · 张说","name":"送考功武员外学士使嵩山署舍利塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怀玉泉，恋仁者，寂灭真心不可见。\n空留影塔嵩岩下，宝王四海转千轮。\n金昙百粒送分身，山中二月娑罗会。\n虚呗遥遥愁思人，我念过去微尘劫。\n与子禅门同正法，虽在神仙兰省间。\n常持清净莲花叶，来亦好，去亦好。\n了观车行马不移，当见菩提离烦恼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}